# Presentation response mappers

## Naming

- `map-*-response.ts` / `map-get-*-response.ts` / `map-create-*-response.ts`
- Pure functions: `mapCancelAppointmentHttpResponse`, …

## Rules

- Pure sync: application output → `{ data }` or `{ data, meta }`
- List: reuse `buildPaginatedListResponse` / established helpers; empty → `{ data: [], meta }` (200)
- Strip/omit only for wire shape / already-decided staff visibility — ACL stays in domain
- No I/O, ports, Nest DI, Prisma

